Translation patch: `create_primitive_date_time`

Change: `let mon = trusted::time_month_from_u8(month)?;` becomes `let mon = match .. { Some(mon) => mon, None => return None };`.
Why: Aeneas does not model `?` on `Option` (`Try`/`FromResidual` for `Option`), as in patch 13.
Behaviour: Identical: this is the definition of `?` on `Option`.

diff --git a/src/value/convert/time.rs b/src/value/convert/time.rs
